            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Each segment compared with all other customers. Intervals are widened to 99.84% (Bonferroni, 0.05 / 31 segments), so they are conservative and can hide small real differences.</run>
